related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-032\n- observed_method: Single 2025-26 playoff G1s, 4 games x 2 offenses; leverage-weighted gap between observed and recommended mix.\n- observed_verdict: descriptive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-008", "score": 0.117, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-008 | Study family SF-APPA-008: Audit of overnight LLM adaptation-analysis batch ('9/10 adaptation predicts winning')\n- observed_research_question: Audit of overnight LLM adaptation-analysis batch ('9/10 adaptation predicts winning')\n- auto_outcome_status: artifact\n- observed_hypothesis: The agent batch's findings (defensive adjustments, point costs, adaptation predicts series winners 9/10) are valid.\n- observed_result: 706 findings with n<5; list_h2h_games called 0 times; series winners LLM-inferred; MIA-BOS G7 score invented (BOS 100 vs graph 84); what_came_next skips a possession; point costs are LLM arithmetic.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: C_artifact (apparent effect produced by a construction, selection or labelling flaw)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Series winners never looked up (0/2073 calls); master '9/10' rule built from LLM inference on inference; low-n claims (e.g. 0.0 PPP on n=3).\n- observed_sample_and_power: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-009"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-024", "score": 0.099, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-024 | Study family SF-APPA-024: Alignment regression: shift toward engine recommendation vs series ORtg\n- observed_research_question: Alignment regression: shift toward engine recommendation vs series ORtg\n- auto_outcome_status: untestable\n- observed_hypothesis: Teams whose playoff mix shifted toward the engine's recommended PT have higher series ORtg residuals.\n- observed_result: Pearson r -0.032, CI [-0.283, +0.209]; Spearman -0.067; OLS beta -5.33 (SE 19.64); clean subset r -0.079 (n=54); tuning fold +0.135, holdout -0.125.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: n=68 with CI width ~0.49 on r; doc says sample thin.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=68; 95% CI [-0.283, +0.209]\n- auto_validation_status: same_pipeline_validation; evidence: APPA-024: 'ootstrap ci, ols with mix-shift control; provisional tuning/holdout split. pearson r -0.032, ci [-0.283, +0.209]; spearman -0.0'"}], "n_results": 4}

